    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSea Breeze, 23 Saint Laurence's Park is a well-appointed, extended three-bedroom, two-bathroom semi-detached home, wonderfully positioned on a spacious corner site in a small and peaceful residential development, just a short walk from the town centre.\n\nEnjoying an excellent setting overlooking Ballynerrin Playground, with views towards the sea beyond, the property offers an ideal combination of convenience, community and privacy. Local schools are within approximately a 5 to 10 minute walk, while the playground directly across from the house, together with the proximity to the town centre and local amenities, places the property at the heart of a friendly and well-established community.\n\nThe house is presented in good condition throughout and has recently benefited from a number of energy-efficiency upgrades, including an external insulation wrap, additional attic insulation and double glazed windows.\n\nInternally, the accommodation is bright and well proportioned, with three bedrooms, one double and two singles two bathrooms, a spacious living room and a wonderful family kitchen to the rear overlooking the garden.\n\nA particular feature of the property is its generous corner site. The beautifully maintained gardens include a large side garden, detached garage and excellent outdoor space, while the rear enjoys a good degree of privacy and is not overlooked.\n\nReady to move into, Sea Breeze, 23 Saint Laurence's Park is a lovely home in a highly convenient yet peaceful setting. With the town centre and schools within easy walking distance, a playground on the doorstep, sea views, generous gardens and a strong sense of community, the property presents an excellent opportunity for families, first-time buyers or those looking for a centrally located home with further potential."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Extended three-bedroom, two-bathroom semi-detached home presented in good condition throughout.</li><li> Superb corner site with generous, beautifully maintained gardens and excellent outdoor space.</li><li> Excellent setting overlooking Ballynerrin Playground, with attractive views towards the sea.</li><li> Recently upgraded energy efficiency, including external insulation wrap, additional attic insulation and double-glazed windows.</li><li> Private rear garden which is not overlooked, together with a large side garden and detached garage.</li><li> Highly convenient location, with the town centre, local schools and amenities all within easy walking distance.</li><li> Excellent accessibility to the N11, providing convenient connections north and south.</li><li> Easy access to the M50, making the property well positioned for commuting towards Dublin and the wider motorway network.</ul>"
      },
